rently, do, and this was shared by fierce healthcare.\n\nI love how they have to explain to UHC how big their change healthcare subdivision is…\n\nThis seems scammy. But it is a scam, after all.\n\nStay tuned. The initial ransom amount was only 0.00067% of annual revenue for UHC.\n\nSubscribe now"}